id=volumeperapp
name=VolumePerApp
version=v0.3.1
versionCode=7
author=PortableDiag
description=Installs VolumePerApp into /system/priv-app and grants MODIFY_AUDIO_ROUTING, so the app can register an AudioPolicy and give each app its own volume fader. Also suppresses the system volume warning at boot when the app asks for it.
